db.org/t/p/original/h2qEomWhmtiyVGi0hjUsYS8bFme.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Lavenza, a 19th-century noblewoman, overhears her husband complaining about her looks, she turns herself into his ideal wife by thrifting the body parts from all the women he desires.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":927054,\"title\":\"Darker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4RveesPiDI8oJ1D9ZuBj02xPCMs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXgKamJsE8gnaCRbyQ762WW7zGM.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rhena's father tells a story about Atlas, a forest entity that whispers stories of the dead to its trees. That same night he disappears into this forest. Rhena does everything she can to get her father back.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1140847,\"title\":\"Cinderella's Revenge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cYB3SHhITJSbRoisgn9QQTP8YkZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xQaR8zugXXGaQjscn77K38GKrV6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cinderella finds freedom from her wicked stepmother with the help of her fairy godmother. Only this time, they unleash a plan of bloody vengeance.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1438207,\"title\":\"Ever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yFbxKeNrOH2K4XnutCCq5cm318T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zFT6pxNBYVQCMrmJpdx52VUliPJ.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of girlfriends arrive at a forest lodge to celebrate, but things take a horrific turn as they realize that the forest is home to bloodthirsty lunatics who perceive themselves to be characters from classic fairy tales.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1353339,\"title\":\"Fairest of them All\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4IGicqxPTrCh8lhDqspN9xDHkG4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vj3IZuDl43hUWdFmJhfGwERJI58.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Mad Hatter has hunted down princesses from the fairytale lands; Ariel, Belle, Alice, Cinderella, Snow White, Tinkerbell and Sleeping Beauty and makes them fight in a Hunger Games style death match. Who is the fairest of them all?\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1329390,\"title\":\"Elmer's Ville\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6uYeC9fWMq2shH8fLCFY8jMYr0H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three teenage friends decide to skip school and head down into the forest. But when they encounter a mysterious beast trying to attack them, an enchanted fairy takes them to her haven town, Elmer's Ville. Even with the fairy's help, little did they know that the fairies have other plans in mind.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1536129,\"title\":\"Snow White: The Sacrifice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5GoaCxyeWNkgM9frJHQyhK80fk1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8EiWv7wVKsqWszkS0YOiwgMw4ta.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This ballet production tells a dark version of the story of Snow White, as a vain and desperate aging queen attempts to have her beautiful daughter murdered.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1119185,\"title\":\"The Waltz of a Lonesome Pigeon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gozGLyMjvWwziNrj2rGnWkCwJBS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An experimental fairy tale about life, death, and spreading your wings. After Cecilia witnesses a bird smashing into her window, she begins to notice her body transforming. Her skin starts to peel and lit